      "content": "Hi there! I need some help with a few exchanges and a cancellation from my recent orders. I’d like to swap my kid’s bicycle for one with a larger frame size—switching to a mountain bike is fine. Also, I want to exchange the jigsaw puzzle from the same order for one with the same difficulty but with 1000 more pieces, and I’d prefer an art theme over animals if that’s possible.\n\nAdditionally, I’d like to exchange my camera for one with a slightly lower resolution, but I want to keep all the other features the same. For both exchanges, I’d prefer to use my Visa card for any payments or refunds.\n\nLastly, I want to cancel just the skateboard from one of my orders. Can you help me with all of this?",
